    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>契合五一国际劳动节（或者五四青年节！），四个生活在大洋两岸四座不同城市的青年劳动者们联合呈现，如果把我们各自的一两周生活浓缩成一天的24个小时，大概会是怎样平凡但却完美的一天。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>串台播客：</span></strong><br><span>啥播客 - 啥啥</span><br><span>佐治亚小帅 - 小帅</span><br><span>有齿之徒 Have face - 不二 </span><br><span>白说白话 - 大白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 我们是谁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="465">07:45</a> 早晨六点半</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="664">11:04</a> 早晨七点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="732">12:12</a> 早晨八点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="872">14:32</a> 早晨九点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a> 上午十点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1256">20:56</a> 上午十一点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1498">24:58</a> 中午十二点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1622">27:02</a> 下午一点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2216">36:56</a> 下午一点半</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2352">39:12</a> 下午三点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2770">46:10</a> 下午四点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2907">48:27</a> 下午五点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3251">54:11</a> 傍晚六点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3498">58:18</a> 傍晚七点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3606">1:00:06</a> 晚上八点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3833">1:03:53</a> 晚上九点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3994">1:06:34</a> 晚上十一点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4134">1:08:54</a> 一个彩蛋：你见过凌晨四点的太阳吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头：平凡的一天 - 毛不易</span><br><span>片尾：晚安 - 丢火车乐队</span></p>]]></description>
