  <item>
    <title>EP5 [3.8妇女节特辑] 要找一个女性楷模，竟然这么难吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6404b56b86730b81738aca9b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6404b56b86730b81738aca9b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Mar 2023 15:29:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><strong><span>你的“女性楷模”是谁？</span></strong></em><br><span>这期特别企划，当我问到身边的朋友们时，很多人的反应都是“想不出来”，可能是因为这个词显得过于高尚、过于完美，作为当代社会的女性已经承担了过多对于美好品质的期待，既要出得厅堂、又要下得厨房。</span><br><span>于是我以为这期征稿最终大概只会收到零星的回复，没想到竟然有【</span><strong><span>27位</span></strong><span>】朋友分享了她们的“女性楷模”（甚至包括我妈），谢谢这些跟我一起共创出这期内容的朋友们！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>你会大概听到来自于什么样的群体的答案</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="379">6:19</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>我们各自生命里的第一位女性楷模</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="422">7:02</a> Carol / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="501">8:21</a> 小胡同学 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 鹿懂懂 /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="990">16:30</a> 西西卡 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1049">17:29</a> 邦尼 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1297">21:37</a> 我妈</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1512">25:12</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>关于事业与家庭平衡的迷思，女性与权力的关系</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1542">25:42</a> 嘟嘟娜依 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1598">26:38</a> 刀刀 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1826">30:26</a> Wenjin /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1928">32:08</a> Vivi / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2177">36:17</a> 小乔 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2246">37:26</a> Kiki /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2419">40:19</a> Orange</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2563">42:43</a> 这些人物只会出现在文艺作品里面吗？</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2575">42:55</a> 大壮 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2780">46:20</a> 小薄荷 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2927">48:47</a> 马拉松</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3077">51:17</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>那些残酷现实世界里的楷模</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3096">51:36</a> 井井 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3221">53:41</a> 华崽 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3329">55:29</a> 白熊 /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3520">58:40</a> Winni / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3661">1:01:01</a> TT / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3783">1:03:03</a> Icelynn / </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">1:05:00</a> 辣条</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4022">1:07:02</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>你我身边的楷模</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4047">1:07:27</a> 碗底 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4152">1:09:12</a> Wenjin / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4288">1:11:28</a> 嘟嘟娜依 / </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4316">1:11:56</a> 夏琳 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4571">1:16:11</a> 西西卡 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4623">1:17:03</a> Dovy</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4718">1:18:38</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>永远争议的关于女性/女权主义最朴素的看法</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4789">1:19:49</a> Winni / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4836">1:20:36</a> 井井 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4890">1:21:30</a> Vivi /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4975">1:22:55</a> Orange / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4995">1:23:15</a> Carol / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5036">1:23:56</a> TT / </span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5068">1:24:28</a> 刀刀 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5150">1:25:50</a> 小乔 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5194">1:26:34</a> 碗底 /</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5211">1:26:51</a> 嘟嘟娜依</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5451">1:30:51</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>关于三八妇女节的讨论</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5456">1:30:56</a> Kiki / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5521">1:32:01</a> 华崽 / <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5549">1:32:29</a> TT</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5624">1:33:44</a></span></strong><span> </span><strong><span>关于女性是世界上最美好的生物这件事</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5678">1:34:38</a> 小新</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头/片尾：I Am Woman - Helen Reddy</span></p>]]></description>
