  <item>
    <title>EP4 2022年度内容大赏: 特别的一年也需要特别的好内容</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63fb19493f01766aae6ebae4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63fb19493f01766aae6ebae4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 26 Feb 2023 08:33:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>受【展开讲讲】的年度内容大赏启发（虽然这一集已经下了），也想认真梳理一下在2022年陪伴、治愈、影响过我的内容，因为个人取向的原因，</span><strong><span>【喜剧】</span></strong><span>和</span><strong><span>【女性主题】</span></strong><span>的含量非常高，希望大家听的开心！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2022年度内容</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="259">04:19</a></span><strong><span> 《一年一度喜剧大赛》第二季</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> </span><strong><span>年度电影《隐入尘烟》</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1010">16:50</a> </span><strong><span>年度纪录片《歇斯底里》</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1260">21:00</a> </span><strong><span>年度书籍《梅里雪山》</span></strong><br><span>拓展内容：纪录片《卡瓦格博》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1556">25:56</a> </span><strong><span>年度书籍《斑马》</span></strong><br><span>拓展内容：《只想金龟换酒》《泛若不系之舟》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1884">31:24</a> </span><strong><span>年度书籍《始于极限》</span></strong><br><span>拓展内容：《厌女》《从零开始的女性主义》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2224">37:04</a> </span><strong><span>年度话剧《永不消逝的电波》《惊梦》《春逝》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最值得重温的旧内容</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2651">44:11</a> </span><strong><span>《算命》</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2864">47:44</a> </span><strong><span>《窃听风暴》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最抚慰人心的内容</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3038">50:38</a> </span><strong><span>单口喜剧专场《丹尼尔斯洛斯：X》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>个人私藏内容</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3245">54:05</a></span><strong><span>《Sex Education 性爱自修室》</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>年度情绪瞬间</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3400">56:40</a> </span><strong><span>一场突如其来的计划变故（在丽水封控）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>片头：完美夏天 - 霓虹花园</span><br><span>片尾：没有理想的人不伤心 - 新裤子</span></p>]]></description>
